;; nbb reads THIS file. It does NOT read deps.edn and it does NOT read bb.edn,
;; and the .cljs in `script/` are run as bare `nbb <file>` -- so a coordinate
;; declared only in deps.edn is invisible to every one of them.
;;
;; Measured 2026-09-10: `script/nbb-classpath.cljk` -- the helper whose whole
;; job is to build the classpath the offline suite runs on -- could not start.
;;
;;     kbb --backend sci script/nbb-classpath.cljk
;;     Could not find namespace: kotoba.lang.text
;;
;; So `script/tests-on-nbb.cljk` could not run either, and this repository's
;; only test that works without a deployed endpoint had been unrunnable since
;; the 2026-09-09 migration off clojure.string. Nothing said so: the JVM suite
;; reads deps.edn and never loads the .cljs, so it stayed green, which is the
;; shape ADR-2609093000 describes and CLAUDE.md carries.
;;
;; :paths and every sha below are COPIED from deps.edn, not chosen here.
{:paths ["src" "."]
 :deps {io.github.kotoba-lang/text {:git/sha "73bdb13ae7a3d004b44bca08be03a3191157a38f"}}}
